I think the mistake was to become very high level.

IMO if you don't find MR till XL13, you should stop leveling up
and make a run for the castle, that way arch-lich will not be
created at Castle, and you have a better chance of surviving.

On reading the spoiler, it seems to me that arch-lich should not
be created even if you are XL30.
http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/343/mon2-343.html

Difficulty for arch-lich is 29.
For generation monster difficulty must be at least the average of XL
and DL.
Now Castle is at around 25DL, so for generation of arch-lich you need
an XL of 33, which is not possible. I am sure there is some other
rule.

For my rule of thumb, I start the run at XL13, if MR is not
available.
I don't dig in this run (except at medusa and lower levels), and
don't
explore the levels completely, and even avoid fighting where-ever
useful.
There are enough XP required that I don't gain a level.

